abase Schema'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Define Project Scope\",\"description\":\"The 'Define Project Scope' activity represents the initial phase of a project where the boundaries, objectives, and deliverables of the project are established.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Design Database Schema\",\"description\":\"The 'Design Database Schema' activity involves creating the structural design of the database, including tables, relationships, and constraints to support the application's data requirements.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Project Status is Delayed\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Development Time > 1000\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Implement Backend Logic' activity occurs with the activation condition that 'A.Payment Method is Credit Card', then an 'Integrate Payment Gateway' activity must eventually occur after the 'Implement Backend Logic' event at some point in the same process instance, provided the correlation condition 'T.Number of Users > 1000' is satisfied, within a time frame between 0 and 1 hour. There is no requirement on what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Implement Backend Logic' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Integrate Payment Gateway' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Implement Backend Logic' events. If 'Implement Backend Logic' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Integrate Payment Gateway'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Backend Logic\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Backend Logic' activity involves coding the server-side functionality of the application, including business rules, data processing, and API development.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Integrate Payment Gateway\",\"description\":\"The 'Integrate Payment Gateway' activity involves connecting the application to a third-party payment processing service to enable financial transact